WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:21.204
"I'm dying," cried Toad from his room.

2
00:00:21.205 --> 00:00:25.271
"Get me a doctor, please!"

3
00:00:25.272 --> 00:00:28.406
Rat stood outside the door.

4
00:00:28.407 --> 00:00:32.878
"Look, Toad," said Rat, "it can't be that bad."

5
00:00:32.879 --> 00:00:38.015
"Ohhhh," moaned Toad.

6
00:00:38.016 --> 00:00:41.161
"Tomorrow you will say . . ."

7
00:00:41.162 --> 00:00:44.671
"What? What?" asked Rat.

8
00:00:44.672 --> 00:00:50.336
"You will say," Toad said sadly,

9
00:00:50.337 --> 00:00:55.278
"‘If only I had done something!'"

10
00:00:55.279 --> 00:00:59.271
Rat wasn't sure what to do.

11
00:00:59.272 --> 00:01:03.871
"I'm not supposed to leave Toad," thought Rat.

12
00:01:03.872 --> 00:01:08.808
"Ohh," moaned Toad.

13
00:01:08.809 --> 00:01:12.871
"But what if he's really sick?" Rat asked himself.

14
00:01:12.872 --> 00:01:17.087
"I'm dying, Rat," said Toad.

15
00:01:17.088 --> 00:01:23.078
"Say good-bye to everyone for me."

16
00:01:23.079 --> 00:01:30.152
"I'd better get a doctor," thought Rat.

17
00:01:30.153 --> 00:01:33.345
"Just to be safe."

18
00:01:33.346 --> 00:01:37.876
"I'll be right back, Toad," said Rat. "Hang on!"

19
00:01:37.877 --> 00:01:45.274
Rat ran downstairs and out the door.

20
00:01:45.275 --> 00:01:49.605
Toad got up at once and put on his best suit.

21
00:01:49.606 --> 00:01:53.703
He opened a drawer to get some money.

22
00:01:53.704 --> 00:01:58.608
"Just a little cash," said Toad to himself.

23
00:01:58.609 --> 00:02:02.543
He stuffed his pockets with bills.

24
00:02:02.544 --> 00:02:06.578
"Let me see," said Toad.

25
00:02:06.579 --> 00:02:09.339
"Ah, the way out!"

26
00:02:09.340 --> 00:02:13.955
Toad knotted his sheets to make a rope.

27
00:02:13.956 --> 00:02:17.007
He lowered himself out the window.

28
00:02:17.008 --> 00:02:21.738
Toad sang a tune as he walked away.

29
00:02:21.739 --> 00:02:24.008
I fooled Rat,

30
00:02:24.009 --> 00:02:26.417
How wonderful is that?

31
00:02:26.418 --> 00:02:28.738
I fooled Rat,

32
00:02:28.739 --> 00:02:34.446
And that is that!
